Usage of golem source add:
  -allow-destination value
    	admit a remote model destination: "<provider>/<canonical base URL>" (repeatable; this command never prompts)
  -collection string
    	optional collection
  -config string
    	path to models.json (default: auto-discover)
  -name string
    	document name (required with -text)
  -ollama-url string
    	override Ollama base URL
  -root string
    	workspace root (default ".")
  -tag value
    	optional tag (repeatable)
  -text
    	ingest stdin as a named text document
  -title string
    	optional display title
